@startuml Manager Manage Promotion
title Sequence Diagram: Quản lý Khuyến mãi & Promotion Engine (Task 6 Refactored)
skinparam theme cerulean

actor Manager
boundary "manage-promotions.html" as UI
control "PromotionController" as Ctrl
entity "PromotionService" as Svc
entity "DiscountStrategyFactory" as Factory
entity "DiscountStrategy" as Strategy
database "Database" as DB

== Tạo chương trình khuyến mãi mới ==
Manager -> UI: Nhập thông tin (Mã, Mức giảm, Hạng tối thiểu...)
UI -> Ctrl: POST /api/promotions (PromotionRequest)
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> Svc: createPromotion(request)
activate Svc
Svc -> DB: save(promotion)
Svc --> Ctrl: PromotionResponse
deactivate Svc

Ctrl --> UI: 201 Created
deactivate Ctrl

== Kiểm tra hiệu lực & Tính giá giảm (Dành cho Booking) ==
[-> Svc: validatePromotion(code, orderAmount)
activate Svc

Svc -> DB: findByCode(code)
DB --> Svc: Promotion

group Logic Kiểm tra (Validation Rules)
    Svc -> Svc: Check isActive, Expiry Date
    Svc -> Svc: Check Usage Limit (usedCount < limit)
    Svc -> Svc: Check Min Order Amount
    
    note over Svc: Mandate: Tier Validation
    Svc -> Svc: Lấy SecurityContext (Username)
    Svc -> DB: findCustomerByUsername(username)
    DB --> Svc: Customer (Tier)
    Svc -> Svc: So sánh Tier (customer >= promotion)
end

alt Hợp lệ
    Svc -> Factory: getStrategy(discountType)
    activate Factory
    Factory --> Svc: ConcreteStrategy (PERCENT/FIXED)
    deactivate Factory
    
    Svc -> Strategy: calculateDiscount(promotion, orderAmount)
    activate Strategy
    Strategy -> Strategy: Tính toán (có xét Max Discount)
    Strategy --> Svc: appliedDiscountAmount
    deactivate Strategy
    
    Svc --> [ : PromotionResponse (Kèm số tiền giảm)
else Không hợp lệ
    Svc --> [ : throw AppException("Lý do lỗi cụ thể")
end
deactivate Svc

@enduml
